x5 pre_down net6 vp gnd inverter_x4
x10 cRef gnd rst reset net5 vp gnd PFD_flip_flop
x1 reset vp vp flip_flop_reset gnd reset_n PFD_passgate
x3 reset_n vp flip_flop_reset net3 gnd reset PFD_passgate
x8 gnd vp net3 net2 PFD_buffor
x11 post_nand net2 vp gnd inverter_x4
.ends


